SimpMusic core (https://github.com/maxrave-dev/core), commit c8999216813587995d941a3215dcf365e60e8422
Romanisation engines from org.simpmusic.lyrics.romanization (LyricsRomanizer, RomanizationLanguage, IndicRomanizer,
HangulRomanizer, KanaRomanizer, CyrillicRomanizer) adapted into
src/commonMain/kotlin/in.shabinder.soundbound/text/Romanizer.kt (moved here from the SoundBound app's
common/shared/.../lyrics/LyricsRomanizer.kt so the app and the matcher share one implementation). Changes: Indic tables
switched from Hunterian to ISO 15919 and extended to every ISCII-aligned Brahmic block, word-final schwa deletion,
Gurmukhi addak/carriers, Hangul liquidisation, Cyrillic language guessed per line; Greek, Thai, Arabic/Persian/Urdu,
Hebrew and Han pinyin added.

